    "https://tulane-ibqejb.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/CX_1001/job/1770": {
      "title": "Assistant Professor",
      "description": "Short Position Description\n\nThe Section of Nephrology & Hypertension and the  Tulane Transplant Institute at Tulane University School of Medicine is recruiting for a Clinician-Educator faculty position. This position will have responsibilities in Transplant Nephrology and General Nephrology. The percent spent in each area is dependent on the needs of the program and interest of the candidates. ",
      "department": null
    },
    "https://tulane-ibqejb.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/CX_1001/job/1798": {
      "title": "Postdoctoral Fellow",
      "description": "The Liya Pi’s Laboratory is seeking a highly motivated and talented Postdoctoral Research Fellow to join our team. Our research investigates the cellular and molecular mechanisms driving hepatic inflammation and liver fibrosis in chronic liver disease progression. Specifically, this project focuses on how the gut-liver axis interacts with dietary insults (such as chronic alcohol consumption, high-fat diets, and metabolic stressors) to trigger hepatic stellate cell (HSC) activation and immune microenvironment remodeling.\n\nThe successful candidate will lead projects exploring how microbial translocation and metabolic dysregulation impair anti-tumor immunity, promote a pro-fibrotic niche, and accelerate transition into hepatocellular carcinoma (HCC). This role offers an exceptional opportunity to utilize advanced in vivo models and cutting-edge translational techniques in a highly collaborative research environment.\n",
      "department": null
    },
    "https://tulane-ibqejb.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/CX_1001/job/1803": {
      "title": "Open Rank - Clinical Assistant/Associate Professor",
      "description": "Tulane University School of Medicine’s John W. Deming Department of Medicine is seeking a physician-scientist to join the faculty. This is a full-time position within the Center for Health Outcomes, Implementation, and Community Engaged Science (CHOICES) Section. The successful candidate will contribute to our excellence in clinical care, research, and education with a key role in expanding the Center's clinical and population research and national visibility by developing and leading extramurally funded investigator-initiated primary care and community-engaged research to improve health.\n",
      "department": null
    },
    "https://tulane-ibqejb.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/CX_1001/job/1712": {
      "title": "Clinical Associate Professor",
      "description": "The Department of Radiology at Tulane University School of Medicine is seeking a highly qualified and collaborative Diagnostic Radiologist to join its expanding academic radiology practice. The Diagnostic Radiologist will provide high-quality, patient-centered imaging interpretation and consultation services across affiliated clinical sites while contributing to the academic, educational, and research missions of the Department of Radiology. The successful candidate will demonstrate excellence in clinical care, interdisciplinary collaboration, medical education, and quality improvement initiatives. Faculty appointment, rank, and track will be commensurate with qualifications and experience.\n\n\n\n⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠",
      "department": null
