    "https://tulane-ibqejb.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/CX_1001/job/436": {
      "title": "Assistant Professor",
      "description": "Tulane University School of Medicine Department of Dermatology is currently recruiting a Board Eligible or Board-Certified Dermatologist to join our exciting practice in the New Orleans metropolitan area.    \n\nWe have a highly active faculty practice where we: \n•Provide comprehensive care to diverse patient populations at all three of our outpatient dermatology clinics \n•Provide excellent care and treatment to patients with psoriasis, atopic dermatitis, cutaneous lymphoma, skin cancer and more\n•Participate in many clinical trials and other research opportunities to provide additional treatment for our patients\n•Engage in educating and teaching our residents and medical students who rotate through our program                      \n \nTulane Dermatology has a highly active Residency Program, with 13 residents, a clinical research fellow and a Clinical Research Unit.  Tulane offers a competitive salary based on rank. \n\nTake this opportunity to learn more about Tulane Dermatology!",
      "department": null
    },
