    "https://tulane-ibqejb.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/CX_1001/job/595": {
      "title": "General Neurology - Clinical Assistant Professor",
      "description": "A banner enterprise of the Tulane Department of Neurology is its comprehensive General Neurology program. Based at University Medical Center and affiliated sites, this program includes a multidisciplinary team of neurologists, advanced practice providers, neuropsychologists, and support staff dedicated to providing high-quality, patient-centered care across the full spectrum of neurological disorders. The program supports evaluation and management of a wide range of conditions.\nThrough its partnership with LCMC Health, Tulane and LSU Neurology faculty collaborate to deliver coordinated, high-quality neurological care across the region, contributing to one of the most comprehensive neurology programs in the Gulf South.",
      "department": null
    },
